## 11. Ambient Features

Features that emerge from the data already collected. Nothing in this section surfaces dashboards, charts, percentiles, or comparisons.

### Loading-screen companions (Skyrim-style)

During Foundation Models inference (2–4 seconds), the tamagotchi runs across the screen with a text callout. Padded to 2-second minimum.

**Ambient pattern observations:**
- "You tend to sleep better the weeks you see friends."
- "Your yellow days often follow good workouts."
- "You've been drinking more water since switching bottles."
- (With period tracking, high-confidence trends): "You tend to sleep lighter the week before your period."

**Gentle reappearance of forgotten good things:**
- "You haven't made your lentil soup in a while."
- "It's been six weeks since your last yoga session — you used to love it."

Max once per month per category. Nagging is disallowed.

### Seasonal rhythm recognition

After roughly a year: scoring weights adjust for historically-harder months, coaching tone softens, workout intensity suggestions bias lower. No UI announces this.

### Friend activity suggestions (symmetric, privacy-clean)

Each phone runs its own local suggestion pass using its own Core Memory, then exchanges only the resulting suggestions. Neither phone sees the other's memory.

### Matched tamagotchi moods

When two friends both show "struggling," a gentle nudge: *"Alex is also having a hard day, want to send hearts?"* Once per friend per week max.

### Meal suggestions from your own history

**Underused favorites.** **Macro-gap suggestions.** **Restaurant mood pairing** (cross-reference meal timestamps with journal tags). Recency rules for restaurants: ≥2 weeks old, or part of a repeat pattern.

### Gentle mood-recovery prompts

When `moodTrend` is declining. Only suggests activities from user's own history. Weather integration via WeatherKit. Non-repeating.

### Shopping lists → share sheet

`UIActivityViewController` for sharing formatted ingredient lists. Secondary option: Apple Reminders via EventKit (`EKReminder`) for true checklist support. Multiple scheduled meals merge into one shopping list.

### Tamagotchi reactions to logged events

Small cheer (all macros hit), flexing (strength), sprint (cardio), sipping (hydration), yawn (sleep logged), sleepy wave (sickness), tiny dance (friend activity). 1–2 seconds, dismissible.

### Wardrobe unlocks from activity patterns

Headband (N cardio), apron (N recipes), cold-weather jacket (N winter outdoor), hiking boots (N hikes with friends), chef's hat (variety threshold).

### Background auto-decorations (temporary)

Optional "auto-add" mode. Running shoes, coffee cups, books, dumbbells, plants. Each fades after ~1 month. Pinnable. Off by default.

### Preventive care thought bubbles

`PreventiveCare` tracking. Ambient thought bubble when overdue. Dismissible, no push notifications. Custom categories with custom cadences.

### Year-ago journal card

On the journal screen, shows entry from exactly one year ago today. Color tag and text only, no interpretation. Only appears when a year-old entry exists.

