## 12. Onboarding and Permissions

### Onboarding screens (6 max)

1. **Welcome + privacy promise**
2. **Goal selection**
3. **Starter customization** — hair, eyes, skin, glasses, clothing color, water bottle, accessibility items
4. **Optional personal details** — age bracket, sex, height, weight (all skippable)
5. **Dietary pattern** — multi-select, skippable
6. **HealthKit + notification permissions**

### Tier 1 — Essential (asked at onboarding)

| Field | Required | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| Goal | Yes | Sets weighting coefficients |
| Age bracket (<18, 18–25, 26–40, 41–60, 60+) | Yes | Sleep target, macro defaults, workout suggestions |
| Biological sex | Optional | Macro defaults, period tracker availability |
| Height | Optional | Macro target calculation |
| Current weight | Optional | Macro target calculation (never tracked over time in v1) |
| Dietary pattern (multi-select) | Optional | Meal analysis, future recipe features |

### Tier 2 — Contextual (asked on first use of each feature)

| Feature | Data collected |
|---|---|
| Exercise (first open) | Activity level, equipment access, injuries/areas to avoid |
| Food (first log) | Preferred units, typical meals per day |
| Hydration (first use) | Container choice, daily target |
| Period (first use) | Typical cycle length, last period start, option to enable period-aware scoring and meal/workout adjustments — all optional |
| Journal (first use) | Nothing — keep friction at zero |
| Friends (first add) | Nothing — just the proximity handshake |

### Tier 3 — Learned passively

- Meal timing patterns (from logged meals)
- Workout frequency baseline (HealthKit + logs)
- Sleep pattern (HealthKit)
- Journal cadence
- Closeness scores (from activities)
- Cycle phase correlations (from period + health data, computed by `BGProcessingTask`)

### Deliberately NOT collected

Exact weight goals, target weight, weight history, body fat %, medical conditions beyond minimal dietary/injury context, mental health diagnoses, medications, social-demographic data.

### Permissions requested at first use (not all at onboarding)

- **HealthKit reads** — heart rate, active energy, sleep analysis, step count, workout type. Requested at first exercise log or first home screen render that needs sleep data.
- **HealthKit writes** — workout samples. Requested alongside read permission with a separate explanation.
- **Bluetooth** — requested at first proximity handshake attempt.
- **Camera** — requested at first journal photo or first handshake photo capture.
- **Photo Library Add** — requested only when the user taps "copy to Photos library."
- **Notifications** — requested during onboarding screen 6.
- **Location (coarse)** — requested at first WeatherKit feature trigger.
- **Background App Refresh** — requested for `BGProcessingTask` (period health trend computation, seasonal rhythm analysis). System-managed scheduling, no user-facing friction.

