## 13. Milestones, Unlocks, and Customization

### Starter customization (onboarding)

Hair (style + color), eyes (shape + color), skin (tone), glasses (optional), clothing color (palette), water bottle (starter container), accessibility items (always available, never a milestone unlock). No body-type selection. One silhouette.

### Unlockable categories

Shirts, pants, shoes, hats, accessories, alternate water bottles, background scene elements.

### Background scenes

MySpace-level customizable. Place, scale, rotate, layer, color freely. Visible only to the user. Never synced.

### Milestone rules

**Every unlock condition must be cumulative and non-resettable.** Direct application of the "no streaks" axiom.

Good shapes: totals (50 meals ever), breadth (tried all 3 meal inputs), social (first friend, first activity), longevity (30 total days used), variety (all 3 macro rings on 10 different days ever).

Disallowed: anything "in a row" or "in a single week," anything tied to weight/calories/body composition, friend count as a target.

### Unlock pacing

First week: 2–3 early unlocks. Middle tenure: steady trickle. Last ~20%: months-long chases. Small subset: friend-activity milestones only.

### User-created items

One credit per 30 days of app use (cumulative, non-resettable). Cap at 3. Freeform drawing on a guide-box canvas. Save (unlimited revisions, draft) vs Publish (permanent, costs 1 credit, runs classifier, names item).

**Publish-time moderation:** Custom Core ML NSFW classifier via `VNCoreMLRequest` for images. `MLTextClassifier` for item names. On-device only.

**Sharing:** In-person only via shop access window (6 hours after handshake). Buy with 1 credit. No reselling. Creator signature preserved.

**Moderation constraints:** On-device classifier + small social graph (12 friends max, in-person-verified). Local hide/block supported. No report button (no centralized distribution).

