                    │  - PeriodEntry                   │
                    │  - PeriodCycleHistory            │
                    │  - PeriodPrediction              │
                    │  - PeriodHealthTrend             │
                    │  (no exports to AI modules)      │
                    └──────────┬──────────────────────┘
                               │ (read-only import)
                    ┌──────────▼──────────────────────┐
                    │  PeriodContextBridge module      │
                    │  - PeriodPhaseSignal             │
                    │  - PeriodNutritionSignal         │
                    │  - PeriodExerciseSignal          │
                    │  (importable by ContextBuilder   │
                    │   for on-device payloads ONLY)   │
                    └─────────────────────────────────┘

                    ┌─────────────────────────────────┐
                    │  PrivateMemoryStore module       │
                    │  - SensitiveMemory               │
                    │  (no exports to OHTTPProvider)   │
                    └─────────────────────────────────┘

                    ┌─────────────────────────────────┐
                    │  PrivateMediaStore module        │
                    │  - Photo                         │
                    │  (no exports to any AIProvider)  │
                    └─────────────────────────────────┘

┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Feature code (meal, workout, journal, period screen, etc.)       │
│   calls: ai.request(.workoutSuggestion, …)                       │
└────────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────┘
                             │
              ┌──────────────▼──────────────┐
              │   ContextBuilder            │
              │  - assembles payload         │
              │  - strips forbidden fields   │
              │  - filters memory via agent  │
              │  - includes PeriodContext     │
              │    signals for on-device only │
              └──────────────┬──────────────┘
                             │
              ┌──────────────▼──────────────┐
              │   AIProvider                │
              │  .onDevice (Foundation       │ ← Full context including
              │             Models)          │   period signals + sensitive memory
              │                              │
              │  .thirdPartyOHTTP            │ ← Stripped: no period signals,
              │                              │   no sensitive memory, no photos
              └──────────────────────────────┘
```

### Audit log

Every AI call records (locally): request type, provider, field names (not values), whether period context was included, response success. Visible in Settings.

### Period data deletion

Deleting period data from `PrivateHealthStore`:
- Removes all `PeriodEntry`, `PeriodCycleHistory`, `PeriodPrediction`, and `PeriodHealthTrend` records
- `PeriodContextBridge` immediately returns `.unknown` / `.noData` for all signals (signals are recomputed from source data, not cached independently)
- `DailyHealthScore.periodPhaseAtTime` entries in historical snapshots are **not** retroactively cleared (the field is a simple enum value already frozen in the snapshot — it reveals only "what phase you were in" on that date, not period-specific detail)
- No period-derived data exists in Foundation Models or CoreML (inference is stateless)
- No period-derived data exists in the memory store (`MemoryExtractionContext` does not import `PeriodContextBridge`)

